From f86f606c9083811011caf65177eea7f60718c64b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gloria Yang <isotopxy@unc.edu>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 23:07:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add education-to-employment conversion data pipeline

Offline build script that combines the conversion model package with an
audited subset of Graduate_Dataset/all_sources (f234e5f) into pinned,
browser-ready JSON under public/data/conversion: snapshot and timeline
atlases, layer registry, coverage, the six reviewed evidence reports and
provenance. ISO3 economies only, real observation years, nulls kept,
no interpolation; nothing is written unless validation passes.

Also adds the source-coverage audit script, independent source-check
notes for the reviewed evidence reports. Data tests follow with the helpers they check.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
